{"version":1,"content":"<p>到最後的時候，黃仁勳看起來心力交瘁，昔日的傳奇性高能量已被清空。此前數周，他一直否認婚外情指控，努力想要保住自己的英偉達CEO職務，但還是在周三晚上無條件屈服了。據一位知情人士透露，黃仁勳往常那種一切盡在掌控之中的風範蕩然無存，他開始説出諸如「隨便」和「我不在乎」這樣的話。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586172.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T05:56:42.165891+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T05:34:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T05:50:00.124950+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T05:50:00.124950+00:00","content_hash":"56ac42b054db8fc3f09f468f2db65de86a3ac75102519961af4b60cc1dcca164","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}